From 973e5d532619be51d1164c42521f7b9ab2b511d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 16:50:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 46/46] pomera_dm250: autoboot countdown 3 seconds

One second was too short to stop it with the Pomera keyboard (to type
emmc and start the built-in firmware).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 configs/pomera_dm250_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configs/pomera_dm250_defconfig b/configs/pomera_dm250_defconfig
index 4e60689b67..869b26c37c 100644
--- a/configs/pomera_dm250_defconfig
+++ b/configs/pomera_dm250_defconfig
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ CONFIG_SYS_LOAD_ADDR=0x60800800
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_BASE=0x20064000
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_CLOCK=24000000
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART=y
-CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=3
 CONFIG_USE_BOOTARGS=y
 CONFIG_BOOTARGS="console=ttyS1,115200n8 console=tty1 root=/dev/mmcblk1p2 rootwait quiet systemd.show_status=yes"
 CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND="sd"
-- 
2.47.3

